/// ownership questions. A hub restart empties the registry; every peer
/// re-hellos on its own reconnect backoff (1s → 2s → 4s …), so a roster
/// snapshot taken seconds after a restart legitimately lacks peers that
/// are about to return (gh-2471: the fabric flushed queued mail on such a
/// snapshot and stranded it in the file inbox). Five seconds rides out
/// the first three backoff steps; misses after it are conclusive again.
